[11.247533, "o", "Attacks and mistakes\r\n"]
[11.248001, "o", "  [X2] ALLOWED  Stolen Helpdesk role: Converse with a model nobody approved (Claude Opus 4.7)\r\n         why:  every check passed: bedrock:InvokeModel\r\n         seen: CloudTrail event history: management event (90 days, free)\r\n         seen: Prompt log: question + answer in /tsg-helpdesk/bedrock/model-invocations (no KMS key of yours, kept FOREVER)\r\n"]
[11.248312, "o", "  [X3] ALLOWED  Stolen Helpdesk role: the approved model, called directly in us-west-2 (no profile)\r\n         why:  every check passed: bedrock:InvokeModel\r\n         seen: CloudTrail event history: management event (90 days, free)\r\n         seen: Prompt log: question + answer in /tsg-helpdesk/bedrock/model-invocations (no KMS key of yours, kept FOREVER)\r\n"]
[11.248569, "o", "  [X5] ALLOWED  Stolen Helpdesk role: DeleteModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration\r\n         why:  every check passed: bedrock:DeleteModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration\r\n         seen: CloudTrail event history: management event (90 days, free)\r\n"]
